{"key": "r22", "title": "Ships Like Mountains", "subtitle": "A cruise on the Atlantic, and Surah Ar-Rahman", "trigger_at": "2027-02-04T13:00:00.000Z", "body": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "captionedImage", "content": [{"type": "image2", "__img": "cover-r22.png", "alt": "Ships Like Mountains"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "On a cruise ship in the middle of the Atlantic Ocean, looking at the huge decks stacked like a building and at the sea all around, one ayah came to my mind."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In Surah Ar-Rahman (55:24):"}]}, {"type": "captionedImage", "content": [{"type": "image2", "__img": "verse-r22-1.png", "alt": "وَلَهُ الْجَوَارِ الْمُنشَآتُ فِي الْبَحْرِ كَالْأَعْلَامِ (Qur'an 55:24)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"His are the ships raised high on the sea like mountains.\"", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Three words"}]}, {"type": "bullet_list", "content": [{"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ships:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " الْجَوَارِ ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "al-jawaari", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), literally \"the runners\", the ones that glide along."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Raised high:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " الْمُنشَآتُ ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "al-munsha'aat", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), built up, lifted up."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Like mountains:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " كَالْأَعْلَامِ ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "kal-a'laam", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "); an عَلَم is a landmark, a mountain you can see from far away."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The people who first heard this had seen nothing like a modern liner. Yet the ayah fits it perfectly. And notice the first word: وَلَهُ \"and His\". We build the ship, but the sea, the wind, the iron and the minds that design it all belong to Him."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The next ayah asks the question of the whole surah (55:25):"}]}, {"type": "captionedImage", "content": [{"type": "image2", "__img": "verse-r22-2.png", "alt": "فَبِأَيِّ آلَاءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ (Qur'an 55:25)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"So which of the favours of your Lord will you deny?\"", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Download this post as a PDF", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", with all the Arabic in Qur'anic script: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ships Like Mountains (PDF)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://www.seemabooks.com/downloads/substack-posts/r22-ships-like-mountains.pdf", "target": "_blank", "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow", "class": null}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "First shared on Instagram: ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "@ibnqutb", "marks": [{"type": "em"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CfQG2oyusrp/", "target": "_blank", "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow", "class": null}}]}]}]}}